# Dependencies

The sole workspace is [the local reader](../../packages/synesis-mcp/package.json), with one [root lockfile](../../package-lock.json). Install development tools with `npm ci --ignore-scripts`; build/test through the root scripts.

Inspect current versions, peer ranges and actual consumers before updating. Remove orphan overrides with their consumers. Prefer current stable versions when compatible and verified; do not force unrelated tools to the same major or conceal an incompatible lockfile with an install fallback.

The standalone package-install CI check must pass without root overrides or other workspace packages. The reader must remain independent of the optional Python preparation environment.
